<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CommBank half yr net profit A$602 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CommBank half yr net profit A$602 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit			  937 vs 867</p>
<p>    Net					   602 vs 542</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			   45 vs 38</p>
<p>    Interest income (billion)	    4.06 vs 3.75</p>
<p>    Other income				802 vs 736</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				66.0 vs 56.6</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			    nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					   325 vs 316</p>
<p>    Interest expense (billions)	  2.34 vs 2.08</p>
<p>    Depreciation				123 vs 120</p>
<p>    Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>    Pay date March 27</p>
<p>    Reg date February 25</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name Commonwealth bank of Australia.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
